      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think `USE_GCC` needs to be `false` for ASan builds. Follow the same pattern from `build_vpp` and add `VPP_EXTRA_CMAKE_ARGS\u003d\"-DVPP_ENABLE_SANITIZE_ADDR\u003dON\"`. \n\n```\n                if [ \"$USE_GCC\" \u003d\u003d \"true\" ] ; then\n                    if ! make UNATTENDED\u003dyes CC\u003dgcc MAKE_PARALLEL_JOBS\u003d${MAKE_PARALLEL_JOBS} VPP_EXTRA_CMAKE_ARGS\u003d\"-DVPP_ENABLE_SANITIZE_ADDR\u003dON build | tee \"$LOG_DIR/build_vpp_debug_gcc.log\" ; then\n                        BUILD_ERROR\u003d\"FAILED \u0027make UNATTENDED\u003dyes CC\u003dgcc MAKE_PARALLEL_JOBS\u003d${MAKE_PARALLEL_JOBS} VPP_EXTRA_CMAKE_ARGS\u003d\"-DVPP_ENABLE_SANITIZE_ADDR\u003dON build\u0027\"\n                        return\n                    fi\n                else\n                    if ! make UNATTENDED\u003dyes MAKE_PARALLEL_JOBS\u003d${MAKE_PARALLEL_JOBS} build | tee \"$LOG_DIR/build_vpp_debug.log\" ; then\n                        BUILD_ERROR\u003d\"FAILED \u0027make UNATTENDED\u003dyes MAKE_PARALLEL_JOBS\u003d${MAKE_PARALLEL_JOBS} build\u0027\"\n                        return\n                    fi\n                fi\n```",
